WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
The panel opens on Circle to Ask, which explains screen awareness and offers session lengths.

00:04.500 --> 00:08.500
A 10 minute session is chosen and Start session is pressed.

00:08.500 --> 00:13.000
A red dot and an ON badge stay visible, with the time left, and a box appears for asking about the screen.

00:13.000 --> 00:17.000
Stop ends the session, and the panel returns to Off.
